ow js-view-dom-id-6cb168422c66e1096b4ed024c4e7e146cac5b0bb35ec4fba8e93a839743d8353">\\012  \\012    <div data-contextual-id="entity.view.edit_form:view=frontpage:location=page&amp;name=frontpage&amp;display_id=page_1&amp;langcode=en" data-contextual-token="Ej4YMIABVCCadHlUzr0KAQn4Fj5_2wR2qNkG1HOl3Yw" data-drupal-ajax-container=""></div>\\012      \\012      \\012\\012<div class="text-content">\\012  <p><em>You haven\\342\\200\\231t created any frontpage content yet.</em></p>\\012  <h2>Congratulations and welcome to the Drupal community.</h2>\\012  <p>Drupal is an open source platform for building amazing digital experiences. It\\342\\200\\231s made, used, taught, documented, and marketed by the <a href="https://www.drupal.org/community">Drupal community</a>. Our community is made up of people from around the world with a shared set of <a href="https://www.drupal.org/about/values-and-principles">values</a>, collaborating together in a respectful manner. As we like to say:</p>\\012  <blockquote>Come for the code, stay for the community.</blockquote>\\012  <h2>Get Started</h2>\\012  <p>There are a few ways to get started with Drupal:</p>\\012  <ol>\\012    <li><a href="https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/index.html">User Guide:</a> Includes installing, administering, site building, and maintaining the content of a Drupal website.</li>\\012    <li><a href="/node/add">Create Content:</a> Want to get right to work? Start adding content. <strong>Note:</strong> the information on this page will go away once you add content to your site. Read on and bookmark resources of interest.</li>\\012    <li><a href="https://www.drupal.org/docs/extending-drupal">Extend Drupal:</a> Drupal\\342\\200\\231s core software can be extended and customized in remarkable ways. Install additional functionality and change the look of your site using addons contributed by our community.</li>\\012  </ol>\\012  <h2>Next Steps</h2>\\012  <p>Bookmark these links to our active Drupal community groups and support resources.</p>\\012  <ul>\\012    <li><a href="https://www.drupal.org/community/events">Upcoming Events:</a> Learn and connect with others at conferences and events held around the world.</li>\\012    <li><a href="https://www.drupal.org/community">Community Page:</a> List of key Drupal community groups with their own content.</li>\\012    <li>Get support and chat with the Drupal community on <a href="https://www.drupal.org/slack">Slack</a> or <a href="https://www.drupal.org/drupalchat">DrupalChat</a>. When you\\342\\200\\231re looking for a solution to a problem, go to <a href="https://www.drupal.org/support">Drupal Support</a> or <a href="https://drupal.stackexchange.com/">Drupal Answers on Stack Exchange</a>.</li>\\012  </ul>\\012</div>\\012  \\012      \\012        \\012</div>\\012</div>\\012\\012    </div>\\012  </div>\\012\\012  </div>\\012\\012              </main>\\012                        \\012          </div>\\012        </div>\\012        <div class="social-bar">\\012          \\012        </div>\\012      </div>\\012    </div>\\012\\012    <footer class="site-footer">\\012      <div class="site-footer__inner container">\\012        \\012        \\012\\012  <div class="region region--footer-bottom grid-full layout--pass--content-medium">\\012    \\012\\012<div id="block-olivero-powered" class="contextual-region block block-system block-system-powered-by-block">\\012  \\012    <div data-contextual-id="block:block=olivero_powered:langcode=en" data-contextual-token="-3kZrhUJreNWo-ghYePk2oeR15H3gdhNJuqRyqtWHDM" data-drupal-ajax-container=""></div>\\012    \\012  <span>\\012    Powered by    <a href="https://www.drupal.org">Drupal</a>\\012    <span class="drupal-logo" role="img" aria-label="Drupal Logo">\\012      <svg width="14" height="19" viewBox="0 0 42.15 55.08" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">\\012<path d="M29.75 11.73C25.87 7.86 22.18 4.16 21.08 0 20 4.16 16.28 7.86 12.4 11.73 6.59 17.54 0 24.12 0 34a21.08 21.08 0 1042.15